{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"514acfaf-8285-450f-b610-bc11dd0259c0","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The upgrade to the current Pollar SDK (`0.12.0`) is complete.\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n1. **Dependency Upgrade ([`package.json`](file:///tmp/h-PQ18ON/package.json))**\n   - Bumped `@pollar/core` and `@pollar/react` from `^0.10.1` to `^0.12.0`.\n\n2. **Bare Origin `baseUrl` ([`src/pollar.ts`](file:///tmp/h-PQ18ON/src/pollar.ts#L6))**\n   - Changed `baseUrl: 'https://sdk.api.pollar.xyz/v1'` to bare origin `'https://sdk.api.pollar.xyz'`. The 0.12 SDK appends the API version (`/v3`) itself.\n\n3. **Null Balance Handling ([`src/balances.ts`](file:///tmp/h-PQ18ON/src/balances.ts#L5-L9))**\n   - Handled `null` balances (which signify an unreadable chain state) by rendering a dash (`'—'`) instead of coercing or defaulting to zero.\n\n4. **KYC Status Handling ([`src/kyc.ts`](file:///tmp/h-PQ18ON/src/kyc.ts#L13-L14))**\n   - Added handling for `'expired'` status in `kycMessage()` returning `'Verification expired'`.\n\n5. **Trustline Sponsorship ([`src/trust.ts`](file:///tmp/h-PQ18ON/src/trust.ts#L6))**\n   - Removed `{ sponsored: true }` parameter from `client.setTrustline(USDC)`, adhering to the updated API where the app sponsorship settings govern fees.\n\n6. **Ramp Quote API Migration ([`src/ramp.ts`](file:///tmp/h-PQ18ON/src/ramp.ts#L5-L18))**\n   - Switched from the retired `getRampsQuote` to `quoteRamp(...)` using the new structured parameter format (`direction`, `fiat`, `asset`, `amount`).\n   - Calculated the rate as `amountIn / amountOut` from the best quote (`quotes[0]`), returning `null` when no quote exists.\n\n### Colleague's Note Applicability\n\nAll five points highlighted in your colleague's note applied directly to this codebase:\n- Pinned `baseUrl` path removal in config.\n- Non-zero rendering for `null` balance in `balanceLines`.\n- Handling the new `'expired'` status on `KycStatus`.\n- Removing the `{ sponsored }` flag on `client.setTrustline`.\n- Migrating `getRampsQuote` to `quoteRamp` and computing `amountIn / amountOut`.\n\nDetailed notes and rationale have been recorded in [`ANSWER.md`](file:///tmp/h-PQ18ON/ANSWER.md). `npx tsc --noEmit` runs cleanly with zero errors.\n","duration_seconds":224.292312,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":296415,"output_tokens":6147,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":1178752,"total_tokens":302562}}}
